  "body": "### What is the expected enhancement?\n\nOne can train VQC in batches using the warm_start=True flag. If one then provides data with a different number of total classes, the code will process the data using the initial_point reached in the previous batch without complaint.\r\n\r\nWhile certainly not critical, it might be friendly to warn the user that the data they are providing probably invalidates the parameters reached during the previous fit.",
